```rust
fn safe_sub(a: usize, b: usize) -> Result<usize, Error> {
    a.checked_sub(b).ok_or(Error::FlexbufferOutOfBounds)
}
```

So `safe_sub(end - 2, root_width.n_bytes())` would return an error if `end - 2 < root_width.n_bytes()`. That's fine.

